WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,210 --> 00:00:05,100
Brother, pack everything up and go

2
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,130
Walk slowly, Xiaolin

3
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:08,130
Will be free later

4
00:00:08,130 --> 00:00:09,130
You can still come back

5
00:00:09,130 --> 00:00:10,130
Take care of business

6
00:00:11,130 --> 00:00:13,340
No need to take care of business

7
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:16,540
From now on, everyone will be your competition

8
00:00:16,540 --> 00:00:17,540
You've reached the other side

9
00:00:18,540 --> 00:00:22,500
Isn’t that store just underselling?

10
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:29,720
So I bought it Xiaolin

11
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:30,720
You can make jokes like this now too

12
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:33,720
That shop costs at least two million

13
00:00:33,720 --> 00:00:34,720
You really have two million

14
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:36,720
In the past, I even had to pay several thousand yuan in rent in arrears.

15
00:00:39,420 --> 00:00:41,350
Land Rover is yours
